        "lineCount": 31,
        "pageNumber": 3,
        "text": "4. Callouts / admonitions
callout (info):
Info
Imports run asynchronously. Large PDFs are processed in the background and notes appear
as soon as each page is parsed.
callout (tip):
Tip
Tag your upload during import (e.g. #exam) so generated notes are filed into the right
deck automatically.
callout (warning):
Warning
Scanned PDFs without a text layer require OCR first — extraction quality depends on scan
resolution.
callout (danger):
Danger
Re-importing the same file overwrites existing notes for that source. This action cannot be
undone.
callout (note):
Note
This whole document is a test fixture. None of the content describes a real billing change or
policy.
